{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Lone Survivors demo allows you to select from one of five different classes, each with their own meta progression and active ability. You will fend off an unending swarm of enemies, test your mettle against two distinct bosses, and unlock and upgrade more than 10 unique auto-attacking weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock Abilities and Upgrades!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each ability that you choose has two unique upgrades, two basic upgrades, and a legendary upgrade! Play with them all and find your perfect match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720490/extras/upgrade-demo.gif?t=1747863637\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Select Unique Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from five different classes in the demo, each with their own unique active ability! Slice your enemies with an axe, or confuse your enemies with a clone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720490/extras/demo-classes.gif?t=1747863637\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beat the level? Try again - but harder!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ascend through three difficulty levels, each adding more challenge than the last! Don't settle for beating the first difficulty, settle for beating them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720490/extras/ascension.gif?t=1747863637\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is just a taste for what the full game will provide, and progress from the meta progression and unlocks in the demo will transfer over to the full game on release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become one of the few to battle and survive against all odds!</p>"